# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .gitignore — Snakemake · Pixi · Python pipeline
#
# Track SOURCE only: workflow/, config/, pixi.toml, pixi.lock, run.sh.
# Ignore everything generated or large, and EVERY hidden (dot) directory.
#
# Raw inputs live OUTSIDE git — a fresh clone must supply, out of band:
#   data/discovery/*.csv.gz, data/holdout/*.csv.gz   (raw Synthea CSVs)
#   resources/snomed_icd10_map.csv                   (~100 MB SNOMED→ICD map)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Pipeline data & generated outputs ──
/data/
/resources/
/results/
/out/
# agents
/spec/

# logs/: ignore everything inside recursively (files AND subdirectories),
# keep only the top-level folder tracked via .gitkeep.
/logs/*
!/logs/.gitkeep

# ── Every hidden (dot) directory — mandatory, no exceptions.
#    Covers .snakemake, .pixi, .venv, .pytest_cache, .mypy_cache,
#    .ruff_cache, .ipynb_checkpoints, .vscode, .idea, .git, … ──
.*/

# ── Python (non-hidden) ──
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
venv/
env/

# ── Large artifacts safety net (in case any land outside the dirs above) ──
*.pkl
*.pt
*.parquet
*.csv.gz

# ── Editor / OS / secrets (files) ──
.DS_StoreThumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.env
.env.local
sync.sh

# agentes
AGENTS.md
skills-lock.json

# ── Documentación local: fuera de git, se conserva en disco ──
docs/
appendix/**/docs/
MemoriaTFM/docs/

# ── Excepción: etiquetas LOINC versionadas ──
# resources/ y *.csv están ignorados por tamaño (mapa SNOMED de ~100 MB), pero el
# fichero de etiquetas es fuente única de los nombres de las figuras del EDA y debe
# viajar con el código. El resto de resources/ sigue ignorado.
!/resources/
/resources/*
!/resources/loinc_labels.csv